// Every item that isn't a block. Every block in blocks.ron is already an item of
// the same name (placing it places the block), so don't list blocks here.
//
// Adding an item: draw its 8x8 icon png in assets/images/blocks, add a line
// here, and use it in code as `Item::NAME` (the name in capitals).
//
// Fields (only `name` is required):
//   name:  lowercase letters, digits and _. Must not be a block's name
//   stack: how many fit in one inventory slot. Default 64
//   icon:  the png (without .png) shown in the inventory. Default: the name
//
// Tools, weapons and the like will get more fields here as they're added.
[
]
